flowchart TD
    Info[只读Engine固定字段] --> Bounded[返回码 类型和字节上限]
    Bounded --> JSON[严格JSON解析]
    JSON --> Support[全部必需能力]
    Support --> Decision[准入或固定拒绝]
    Decision --> Existing[原Profile省略原因或MCP连接事件]
    Profile[原Profile资源请求] --> Plan[原Plan与Approval摘要]
    Plan --> Launch[原固定资源argv]
    Decision -->|仅准入| Launch
